			<TRAN name="oblon_lndn_046r" title="주식보유서비스 세전 수수료 조?" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="200" _ulen="152" >

PROS_CLS_CODE^처리구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
STA_DATE^시작일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
FIN_DATE^종료일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="129" _ulen="101" >

STND_DATE^기준일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
UI_FEE_CLS^UI수수료구분^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
LNDN_FEE^대여수수료^19^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock2" inout="out" _len="112" _ulen="82" >

LNDN_FEE^대여수수료^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
STCK_HLDN_SVC_FEE^주식보유서비스수수료^19^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="40" _ulen="32" >

SRNO^일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
